<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-month T-bill yield set down at 22.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-month T-bill yield set down at 22.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.11 percent, down from 22.29 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency (AKK) said on Tuesday HTBM.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	2,297.60 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allgcated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.11 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.3322 pct</p>
</text>
